{"unit_id":"Loopiplusplus__dsh-plugin-toggle-manager#card-zh","repo":"Loopiplusplus/dsh-plugin-toggle-manager","commit":"17d138073354f42a2fdfa2bfb767efa92c4c3214","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle-manager 是面向 DSH Web 的可视化插件管理器，在设置的插件管理页展示 Loader 识别的插件并支持按名称或 ID 搜索。用户可启用或停用可管理插件，创建、编辑、保存和应用多套插件组合，也可卸载当前 profile 直接安装的独立第三方插件。操作会更新 profile 配置并为配置文件保留备份；核心组件和管理器自身保持启用。适合希望在网页设置界面整理插件状态和场景组合的 DSH Web 用户。需要安装到 DSH Web profile，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:293-305","lib/index.js:287-377"]}
{"unit_id":"Loopiplusplus__dsh-plugin-toggle-manager#card-en","repo":"Loopiplusplus/dsh-plugin-toggle-manager","commit":"17d138073354f42a2fdfa2bfb767efa92c4c3214","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle-manager adds a plugin tab to DSH Web settings. Users can search plugins, enable or disable eligible entries, save and apply plugin sets, and uninstall eligible profile packages. Core components and the manager stay enabled. It requires a DSH Web profile; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:293-305","lib/index.js:287-377"]}
