{"unit_id":"Loopiplusplus__dsh-plugin-toggle-manager#feature-1","repo":"Loopiplusplus/dsh-plugin-toggle-manager","commit":"17d138073354f42a2fdfa2bfb767efa92c4c3214","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle-manager 的功能「插件状态管理」：在插件管理页查看 Loader 识别的插件、启用状态和分类，并可搜索名称或 Loader ID。选择插件操作即可启用或停用可管理项，核心组件和分组不会被切换。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:291-295","lib/index.js:238-311"]}
{"unit_id":"Loopiplusplus__dsh-plugin-toggle-manager#feature-2","repo":"Loopiplusplus/dsh-plugin-toggle-manager","commit":"17d138073354f42a2fdfa2bfb767efa92c4c3214","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle-manager 的功能「插件组合」：用户可以从当前状态或空白可选插件状态创建组合，编辑其中的插件，保存并应用组合，也能删除组合记录。系统必需组件和管理器会继续保留。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:342-377"]}
{"unit_id":"Loopiplusplus__dsh-plugin-toggle-manager#feature-3","repo":"Loopiplusplus/dsh-plugin-toggle-manager","commit":"17d138073354f42a2fdfa2bfb767efa92c4c3214","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-toggle-manager 的功能「卸载独立插件」：在管理页对符合条件的第三方插件发起卸载并确认。服务会清理该包相关的 profile 启动项、组合引用、依赖记录、锁文件记录和安装链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:112-129","lib/index.js:312-336"]}
